OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits manslaughter after
OL,4,Apunch killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted killing another with
OL,7,Fa punch in a quiet village.
OL,9,FUmidbek Akhmedov, 31, of Summer Lane in
OL,10,FBromeswell, Suffolk, pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fthe manslaughter of Zoirbek Odamboev,
OL,12,Falso in his 30s, at Ipswich Crown Court
OL,13,Ftoday.
OL,15,FAkhmedov will be sentenced on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe court heard that both the
OL,18,Fprosecution and defence barristers
OL,19,Fagreed it fell into category C in the
OL,20,Fsentencing guidelines, with a starting
OL,21,Fpoint of six years imprisonment.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
